    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d290">

                <pb facs="0466" n="370" xml:id="pg370"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr. Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-06-03"><hi rendition="#italic">June 3,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 671.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have received your telegram of the 28th
                    ultimo reading as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Colonial office has received following message from governor Sierra
                            Leone: “Regret to report Reverend and Mrs. McGrew murdered Paina
                            (Taima?) about 8th May.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">William R. Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
